<% content_for :title, "已创建" %>

<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 760px;">
  <%= render partial: "shared/topnav" %>

  <div class="alert alert-success">
    <h3 class="mb-2">已创建</h3>
    <p class="mb-0">把下面的短地址和取件码交给收件人即可。创建者不需要再模拟一次读取。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label class="form-label fw-semibold">短地址</label>
    <input class="form-control form-control-lg font-monospace" type="text" readonly value="<%= @share_url %>" onclick="this.select();">
  </div>

  <div class="mb-3">
    <label class="form-label fw-semibold">取件码</label>
    <input class="form-control form-control-lg font-monospace" type="text" readonly value="<%= @share_passphrase %>" onclick="this.select();">
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4 text-muted">
    地址码：<code><%= @share_code %></code>；达到设定的成功读取次数或有效期后会失效。密码输错不会消耗读取次数。
  </div>

  <div class="d-flex gap-2">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="<%= new_quick_push_path %>">再创建一个</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="<%= pushes_path %>">查看我的 Push</a>
  </div>
</div>
